# Tasks: Kit Install Hardening

**Spec**: [spec.md](file:///home/andre/projetos/assistidos/kit_src/specs/kit-install-hardening/spec.md) | **Plan**: [plan.md](file:///home/andre/projetos/assistidos/kit_src/specs/kit-install-hardening/plan.md)
